@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch06.04: 주문 생성 시퀀스 다이어그램 (재고 차감 + 주문 생성)

actor Client
participant "OrderController" as Controller
participant "OrderService" as Service
participant "ProductRepository" as ProductRepo
participant "Product\n(재고)" as Product
participant "OrderRepository" as OrderRepo
participant "Order\n(주문)" as Order

Client -> Controller: POST /api/orders\n(OrderCreateRequest)
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: @Valid 검증
Controller -> Service: createOrder(request)
activate Service

note right of Service
    @Transactional
    전체 작업을 하나의
    트랜잭션으로 처리
end note

Service -> ProductRepo: findByProductIdWithLock(productId)
activate ProductRepo

ProductRepo -> Product: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE\n(비관적 락)
activate Product
Product --> ProductRepo: Product Entity
deactivate Product

ProductRepo --> Service: Product Entity
deactivate ProductRepo

Service -> Service: 재고 확인\nisStockAvailable(quantity)

alt 재고 부족
    Service --> Controller: InsufficientStockException
    Controller --> Client: 400 Bad Request
    note right of Service
        트랜잭션 롤백
        재고 차감 안 됨
    end note
else 재고 충분
    Service -> Product: decreaseStock(quantity)
    activate Product
    note right of Product
        재고 차감
        (아직 DB 반영 안 됨)
    end note
    Product --> Service: 완료
    deactivate Product

    Service -> Service: Order 엔티티 생성
    Service -> OrderRepo: save(order)
    activate OrderRepo

    OrderRepo -> Order: INSERT INTO orders
    activate Order
    Order --> OrderRepo: Order Entity
    deactivate Order

    OrderRepo --> Service: Order Entity
    deactivate OrderRepo

    Service -> Service: OrderResponse 변환
    Service --> Controller: OrderResponse
    deactivate Service

    note right of Service
        트랜잭션 커밋
        - 재고 차감 UPDATE
        - 주문 INSERT
        모두 성공 또는 모두 롤백
    end note

    Controller --> Client: 201 Created\n(OrderResponse)
end
deactivate Controller

@enduml

' ==========================================
' 트랜잭션 롤백 시나리오
' ==========================================
@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title 트랜잭션 롤백 시나리오

participant "OrderService" as Service
participant "ProductRepository" as ProductRepo
participant "Product" as Product
participant "OrderRepository" as OrderRepo
participant "Order" as Order
participant "트랜잭션\n컨텍스트" as TX

Service -> ProductRepo: findByProductIdWithLock()
activate ProductRepo
ProductRepo -> Product: SELECT FOR UPDATE
Product --> ProductRepo: Product Entity
ProductRepo --> Service: Product Entity
deactivate ProductRepo

Service -> Product: decreaseStock(quantity)
activate Product
note right of Product
    재고 차감
    (트랜잭션 컨텍스트에만 반영)
end note
Product --> Service: 완료
deactivate Product

Service -> OrderRepo: save(order)
activate OrderRepo

OrderRepo -> Order: INSERT INTO orders
activate Order

Order --> OrderRepo: DB 오류 발생!
deactivate Order

OrderRepo --> Service: RuntimeException
deactivate OrderRepo

Service -> TX: 트랜잭션 롤백
activate TX
note right of TX
    모든 변경사항 롤백
    - 재고 차감 취소
    - 주문 생성 취소
    원자성 보장
end note
TX --> Service: 롤백 완료
deactivate TX

Service --> Service: 예외 전파

@enduml

' ==========================================
' 동시성 제어: 비관적 락
' ==========================================
@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title 동시성 제어: 비관적 락 (PESSIMISTIC_WRITE)

participant "요청 1" as Req1
participant "OrderService" as Service1
participant "요청 2" as Req2
participant "OrderService" as Service2
participant "Product\n(재고: 10)" as Product

Req1 -> Service1: createOrder()\n(수량: 5)
activate Service1

Service1 -> Product: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE\n(락 획득)
activate Product
Product --> Service1: Product (락 보유)
note right of Product
    비관적 락
    다른 트랜잭션은
    대기 상태
end note

Req2 -> Service2: createOrder()\n(수량: 6)
activate Service2

Service2 -> Product: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE\n(락 대기)
activate Product
note right of Product
    요청 1이 락을
    보유 중이므로
    대기
end note

Service1 -> Product: decreaseStock(5)\n재고: 10 → 5
Product --> Service1: 완료
deactivate Product

Service1 -> Service1: 주문 저장
Service1 -> Product: 트랜잭션 커밋\n(락 해제)
activate Product
Product --> Service1: 커밋 완료
deactivate Product
deactivate Service1

Product --> Service2: 락 획득
activate Product
Service2 -> Product: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE\n(락 획득)
Product --> Service2: Product (재고: 5)
deactivate Product

Service2 -> Product: decreaseStock(6)
activate Product
note right of Product
    재고 부족!
    (5 < 6)
    예외 발생
end note
Product --> Service2: InsufficientStockException
deactivate Product

Service2 --> Req2: 400 Bad Request
deactivate Service2

@enduml

' ==========================================
' 예외 처리 흐름
' ==========================================
@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title 예외 처리 흐름

participant "Client" as Client
participant "OrderController" as Controller
participant "OrderService" as Service
participant "GlobalExceptionHandler" as Handler

Client -> Controller: POST /api/orders
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: createOrder(request)
activate Service

alt 상품 없음
    Service -> Service: ProductNotFoundException 발생
    Service --> Controller: ProductNotFoundException
    Controller --> Handler: 예외 전파
    activate Handler
    Handler -> Handler: 404 Not Found로 변환
    Handler --> Client: 404 Not Found\n{"error": "Product Not Found"}
    deactivate Handler
else 재고 부족
    Service -> Service: InsufficientStockException 발생
    Service --> Controller: InsufficientStockException
    Controller --> Handler: 예외 전파
    activate Handler
    Handler -> Handler: 400 Bad Request로 변환
    Handler --> Client: 400 Bad Request\n{"error": "Insufficient Stock"}
    deactivate Handler
else 입력 검증 오류
    Controller -> Controller: MethodArgumentNotValidException
    Controller --> Handler: 예외 전파
    activate Handler
    Handler -> Handler: 400 Bad Request로 변환
    Handler --> Client: 400 Bad Request\n{"error": "Validation Error"}
    deactivate Handler
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller

note right of Handler
    @RestControllerAdvice
    전역 예외 처리
    일관된 에러 응답
end note

@enduml

' ==========================================
' 핵심 메시지 4가지
' ==========================================
@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title 핵심 메시지 4가지

package "1. 트랜잭션 관리 (ACID)" {
    class Atomicity {
        모든 작업 성공 또는 모두 실패
        @Transactional
    }
    
    class Consistency {
        데이터 무결성 유지
        제약조건 검증
    }
    
    class Isolation {
        동시성 제어
        비관적 락
    }
    
    class Durability {
        커밋 후 영구 저장
        트랜잭션 로그
    }
    
    Atomicity --> Consistency
    Consistency --> Isolation
    Isolation --> Durability
}

package "2. 비즈니스 로직 순서" {
    class Step1 as "1. 상품 조회\n(비관적 락)"
    class Step2 as "2. 재고 확인"
    class Step3 as "3. 재고 차감"
    class Step4 as "4. 주문 생성"
    class Step5 as "5. 주문 저장"
    
    Step1 --> Step2
    Step2 --> Step3
    Step3 --> Step4
    Step4 --> Step5
}

package "3. 예외 처리 전략" {
    class CustomException as "Custom Exception" {
        명확한 에러 메시지
        계층 구조
    }
    
    class RestControllerAdvice as "@RestControllerAdvice" {
        전역 예외 처리
        HTTP 상태 코드 매핑
    }
    
    class ErrorResponse as "일관된 에러 응답" {
        표준 형식
        timestamp, status, error, message
    }
    
    CustomException --> RestControllerAdvice
    RestControllerAdvice --> ErrorResponse
}

package "4. 단위 테스트 작성" {
    class Given {
        테스트 데이터
        Mock 설정
    }
    
    class When {
        테스트 메서드 호출
    }
    
    class Then {
        결과 검증
        Mock 호출 확인
    }
    
    Given --> When
    When --> Then
}

@enduml

